OL,3,GNEWSAAI cameras have 'more capability'
OL,4,Athan officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force using AI cameras to
OL,7,Fdetect traffic offences said they had
OL,8,F"considerably more capability" than
OL,9,Fhuman officers as a trial detected more
OL,10,Fthan 5,300 offenders in a month.
OL,12,FIn the summer, Suffolk Police trialled
OL,13,Fthe technology on the A12 where they
OL,14,Fcaught drivers without seatbelts and
OL,15,Fusing mobile phones.
OL,17,FThe force said half of the offences had
OL,18,Fbeen dealt with so far, resulting in
OL,19,F1,705 people completing awareness
OL,20,Fcourses and a further 1,003 people
OL,21,Fpaying fixed penalties.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
