OL,3,GNEWSAAI cameras have 'more capability'
OL,4,Athan officers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cameras were deployed again on the
OL,7,FA14 on Tuesday and Ch Insp Gary Miller
OL,8,Fsaid the "sheer volume" of offences
OL,9,Fduring the trial highlighted the need
OL,10,Ffor them.
